+# Architecture v2
+
+This approved decision continues HTTP with JSON payloads for public client
+integrations and permits gRPC only for internal high-throughput services with
+team-controlled endpoints. It explicitly supersedes the Protocol Review's global
+gRPC-default recommendation.
+
+## Important assertions
+
+- Public client integrations continue to use HTTP with JSON payloads; this approved
+  decision supersedes the Protocol Review recommendation for gRPC as the default
+  transport (heading "Approved decision", lines 5-12). Reconciled in
+  [transport-public-http-json](../topics/transport.md#claim-transport-public-http-json).
+- Internal high-throughput services may use gRPC when both endpoints are controlled
+  by the team (heading "Approved decision", lines 5-9). Reconciled in
+  [transport-internal-controlled-grpc](../topics/transport.md#claim-transport-internal-controlled-grpc).
